    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95419" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῶμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκώπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jest,gibe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				159.15
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				244
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				542
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				750
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				316
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				452b
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν σκώμματος μέρει</span>
			by way of a <i>joke</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.126
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς γέλωτα καὶ σκώμματ᾽ ἐμβαλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					54.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ς. καταστῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					75
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. παρὰ γράμμα</span> a
			<i>pun</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1412a29
			</span></i>; it generally implies scurrility, but not necessarily,
				v.
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1128a30
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.631e
			</span></i>.</div>
